     {
      "id": 3517173,
      "postDate": "2026-08-26T10:45:58.533Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "I do not convert a right to a left knee, and thankfully not, I would be a terrible doctor.\n\nI detect which is which with a anatomical model, and patient position. It was reasonably straight forward after looking at the examples and how the knee bends.\n",
